# Keep the shell/python/YAML sources LF so the runners never see CRLF.
# The main project has no .gitattributes and its predictor files are CRLF,
# which is a known trap (AGENTS.md section 9 item 13). This repo is built fresh
# from Linux, so we pin LF and normalise on commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.gz   binary
*.tar  binary
